    TONE 0
  ATTACK 12
 SUSTAIN 66
   LEVEL 50
 
 ----------------------------------
 A-2
 	b. OVERDRIVE
 
   TONE -8
  DRIVE 65
 TURBO: OFF
  LEVEL 46
 
 ----------------------------------
